---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = 'Essiac Tea — ';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <Fragment slot="title">{pageTitle}</Fragment>

  <section class="prod-hero">
    <img class="bg" src="/images/products/essiac-small.png" alt="" />
    <div class="inner">
      <h1>Essiac Tea</h1>
      <p>Traditional herbal blend with a long history of wellness use and stories of supporting the body in it's ability to completely heal itself</p>
      <a href="/products" class="btn">Shop Now</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content">
    <h2>About Essiac Tea</h2>
    <p>This is a very famous tea, and it is hard to find the true recipe. Without knowing the history of Nurse Caisse and her success in helping thousands of people who suffered from disease so many years ago, you can be easily swayed into buying the wrong recipe of Essiac Tea. Nurse Caisse was pressured by a pharmaceutical interest to sell her recipe, and she did sell it. That recipe is the one touted all over the internet as “the original recipe” and “from Canada”. It is a 4 herb recipe. The problem with this recipe is that it was her original recipe, but not her best recipe. She worked with Dr. Charles Brusch for years to make it more effective and ended up with an eight herb recipe that was actually famous for helping the ill. She passed on her recipe directly to Dr. Charles Brusch. Our Essiac Tea comes straight from the family who was given the recipe by Dr. Charles Brusch. It is the real deal, endorsed by Nurse Caisse.

Ingredients from the USA: Blessed Thistle, Burdock Root, Kelp, Red Clover, Sheep Sorrel, Slippery Elm Bark, Turkish Rhubarb Root, Watercress.</p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .prod-hero{position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;min-height:360px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;margin-top:8px}
    .bg{position:absolute;inset:0;object-fit:cover;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:.18;z-index:-1}
    .inner{padding:36px 20px 28px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
    .inner h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(2rem,3vw,2.6rem)}
    .inner p{margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:#111827;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .content{max-width:900px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 4px}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
